triggerall = var(21) = 2
triggerall = fvar(9) = 4.5
trigger1 = parent,var(20) = [10,95]
value = 2700 + parent,var(20)
ignorehitpause = 0

[State 3660,];攻撃移動	通常技系	席順１の幽霊へ
