triggerall = var(21) = 1
triggerall = fvar(9) = 4.5
trigger1 = parent,var(10) = [10,95]
value = 2700 + parent,var(10)
ignorehitpause = 0

[State 3660,];停滞後、基準近くにきたら速度５にできる
